# LeakSanitizer suppressions for third-party allocations that are not leaks we
# can do anything about. Used automatically by the pytest driver; harmless in
# builds without a sanitizer.
#
# HDF5 registers process-global property lists the first time the library is
# opened and never frees them. One-time initialisation, reported once per run
# as a direct leak from H5open.
leak:libhdf5
leak:H5_init_library
leak:H5P__register_real
